    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "#####PROPERTY AT A GLANCE #####\r\n\r\n##110sq m of accommodation with an additional 20 sq m floored attic space, accessed via a permanent staircase and benefiting from Velux windows##\r\n##B energy rating ##\r\n##Additional versatile upstairs room - ideal for home office among other ##\r\n##Large open plan living area ##\r\n##Landscaped rear garden with concrete shed ##\r\n##Off street parking ##\r\n##Overlooking green - ideal for families and homeowners ##\r\n\r\nEarnest are delighted to present No. 6 Saddlers Avenue to the sales market. This substantial 110 sq. m. two-bedroom terraced house is ideally positioned overlooking a green and offers well-proportioned accommodation together with a number of useful additional spaces.\r\n\r\nThe property will appeal to both homeowners and families and benefits from a versatile additional room upstairs, a converted attic spanning the width of the house, off-street parking and a concrete-built shed.\r\n\r\nOn entering, the ground floor accommodation briefly comprises a large and bright open-plan living room featuring decorative coving, a ceiling centrepiece, laminate flooring and a decorative fireplace with mantelpiece.\r\n\r\nFurther along the hall is a separate kitchen and dining area, together with a useful utility room and additional under-stairs storage. Patio doors from the dining area provide access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises a generous master bedroom with en-suite, a second double bedroom, a versatile additional room suitable for a variety of uses including a home office, the converted attic and the family bathroom. The converted attic spans the width of the house and benefits from stairs, flooring and Velux windows.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is approached via a low-maintenance gravelled front garden with off-street parking. The rear garden is neatly presented with a combination of gravelled and mulched areas, mature trees and a concrete-built shed, providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nOverall, No. 6 Saddlers Avenue offers spacious and versatile accommodation in a convenient setting overlooking a green, with a range of features that make it an attractive home for owner-occupiers and families alike.\r\n\r\nLOCATION :\r\nThe location is excellent, situated just off the N3 and close to a host of schools, shops, restaurants and local amenities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just minutes away, while the property also benefits from easy access to the N3 and M50, providing convenient connectivity to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nCall now for viewing times !!!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. While we have taken great care to ensure the accuracy of this information, some details may have been provided by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and encourage viewers to seek their own opinion on any concerns they may have."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION :\r\n\r\nLiving room, 5.50m x 5.20m : bright,  large open plan room, coving and ceiling centre piece, laminate flooring , decorative mantlepiece, alarm panel , 2 x windows \r\n\r\nkitchen and dining area , 2.95m x 5.20m :  L shaped kitchen with floor , wall cabinets and timber surround , gas hob, tiled back splash, patio doors to the rear \r\nUtility room , 2m x .90m : plumbed for washing machine , additional under stairs storage \r\n\r\nMaster bedroom , 2.95m x 5.20m :  spanning the width of the house , 2 x windows , built in wardrobes , carpet \r\nEn suite, 1.30m X 1.80m : partially tiled , shower cubicle , WC , WHB \r\n\r\nBedroom 2, 3.62m x 2.80m  : Built in bespoke surround wardrobes, 2 x windows , carpet \r\n\r\nAdditional versatile room,3.62m x 1.30m  : can be used for many uses including home office \r\n\r\nAttic conversion, 3.95 x 5.20m :  Floored attic space, accessed via a permanent staircase and benefiting from Velux windows.\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom, 2.10m X 1.80m:partially tiled, bath, electric shower, WC , WHB \r\n\r\nExterior :\r\nFront garden: Low-maintenance gravelled front garden with off-street parking\r\nRear garden : Neatly presented with a combination of gravelled and mulched areas, mature trees and a concrete-built shed, providing excellent additional storage."
      },
